//Description strings.
@1000 = "Magic Orb"
@1001 = "Orb created by the Magic Orbs spell.

STATISTICS:

Combat Abilities:
  Long Range: due to the magical nature of orbs, they can be thrown at long distance.
  Raw Magic: deals 3d6 points of magic damage, bypassing magic resistance.

THAC0: +10
Weight: 0"
